OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment scraps plans to upgrade
OL,4,AA46 bypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to upgrade the A46 bypass around
OL,7,FNewark have been scrapped by the
OL,8,Fgovernment, which said the scheme was
OL,9,F"no longer affordable".
OL,11,FThe project, which was expected to cost
OL,12,Fup to #500m, was approved in October
OL,13,F2025 and would have filled in a dual
OL,14,Fcarriageway gap between the villages of
OL,15,FFarndon and Winthorpe.
OL,17,FEarlier in the year, the government
OL,18,Fannounced the scheme - along with a
OL,19,Fproject to improve the A38 in Derby -
OL,20,Fcould be scrapped in order to pay for
OL,21,Fincreased defence spending.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
