OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment scraps plans to upgrade
OL,4,AA46 bypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to Paul Peacock - leader of
OL,7,FNewark and Sherwood District Council -
OL,8,Fon Thursday, MP Justin Madders, the
OL,9,Fminister for roads, confirmed the
OL,10,Fschemes would no longer be going ahead.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
